    OUTPUT: result=PASS, 100% zero-touch (2/2 lap commits), wall_clock 16s — BUT spirit_verdict='' spirit_reason='no diff to judge', despite the agent writing AND committing a real fix (log shows '[main 1729daa] chore: seed breakage' + '[main 3bb5edb] feat: implement track task'). The tally_human_touches correctly saw '2 lap commit(s)'; the spirit judge saw nothing.
