  description: |
    One screen the operator reads to hold the dial. Shows: current AUTONOMY_LEVEL; what each live agent/session is doing; what's queued; merges in the last hour; and THE metric — coordination acts performed by an agent vs by the operator (the empty-chair indicator). Read-only, fast, pause-immune (local state only).
