- id: EFFECTIVE-1211
  domain: EFFECTIVE
  title: "EFFECTIVE: EFFECTIVE-1101: Create failing tests for each placeholder (EFFECTIVE-440 slice)"
  status: open
  priority: P2
  effort: s
  description: |
    Add a dedicated failing test in each file that currently contains a `todo!()` placeholder. In `crates/chump-orchestrator/src/dispatch.rs` a new test `test_placeholder_dispatch` is added inside the existing `mod tests` block that calls the function containing the `todo!()` so it panics. Likewise, in `crates/chump-curator-supervisor/src/main.rs` a new test `test_placeholder_main` is added that invokes the placeholder code. These tests are compiled but expected to fail until the `todo!()` is replaced, guaranteeing one failing test per placeholder.
    
    Target file(s):
    - crates/chump-orchestrator/src/dispatch.rs
    - crates/chump-curator-supervisor/src/main.rs
    
    (Spec enriched by chump-gap-enricher — EFFECTIVE-446. Original filer context preserved below.)
  acceptance_criteria:
