  status: open
  priority: P1
  effort: s
  acceptance_criteria:
    - When `--apply` is provided, the command first generates and validates the Roadmap exactly as in the bare variant (Slice 0)
    - It iterates over the gaps listed in the Roadmap; at least one gap must exist
    - For each gap, it shells out to `chump gap reserve --outcome <provided-outcome-id>` using a draft payload derived from the Roadmap gap entry (the exact interface matches the existing `chump gap reserve` CLI contract)
    - "The shell invocation inherits MISSION-045/pillar/similarity gates automatically (since it uses the existing `chump gap reserve` command, mirroring the pattern in `bootstrap.rs:871-931`)"
