    - ci_config_only matches .github/workflows/** and no other path
    - "For each REQUIRED check (test, audit, ACP), add a \"shim\" job that auto-passes when its lane is irrelevant — e.g. cargo-test-required passes immediately if rust_code=false and ci_config_only=false; same pattern for fast-checks-required, clippy-required, audit-required"
    - "Validate end-to-end: docs-only PR (gap YAML) opens, only docs-lint + audit-required-shim run, total CI wall time <2 min"
    - docs/process/CI_LANES.md (new) explains the lane model + how to add a new lane
