  description: |
    Add a check for the sentinel file `.chump-locks/loop-stop-requested` at the start of each iteration in the main dispatch loop of `scripts/dispatch/_pick_gap.py` (function `main`) and in the backoff loop of `scripts/ops/organ-watchdog.sh` (function `organ_watchdog_in_backoff`). If the file exists, log a clear message and exit with code 0, allowing an operator to stop the loop within one cycle by creating the file.
    
    Target file(s):
    - scripts/dispatch/_pick_gap.py
    - scripts/ops/organ-watchdog.sh
    
    (Spec enriched by chump-gap-enricher — EFFECTIVE-446. Original filer context preserved below.)
