    - Run `scripts/dispatch/_pick_gap.py` in a loop; while it is running, execute `touch .chump-locks/loop-stop-requested`; observe that the script prints 'stop requested' (or similar) to stdout/stderr and exits before processing the next gap.
    - Run `scripts/ops/organ-watchdog.sh` in backoff mode; create the sentinel file; verify that the script prints 'stop requested' to stderr and exits with code 0 within one backoff interval.
    - After the script exits, remove the sentinel file and restart the script; confirm it runs normally without exiting immediately.
