  description: |
    Install sccache binary on all 4 self-hosted runners + configure Cloudflare R2 as shared backend. Set RUSTC_WRAPPER=sccache in CI workflows. First cache hit pays full cost; subsequent hits across runners + PRs return cached compiled artifacts. Estimated impact: 50-70% reduction in cargo build time on cache hits. For our 47-PR day, this is ~3-4hrs of CPU saved.
