    - sccache --show-stats step added at end of cargo-test + clippy jobs for observability (cache hits / misses / cache size)
    - "Measurement: compare wall-clock of cargo build --release --bin chump before + after on a representative PR. Document the speedup in commit body"
    - "Smoke test scripts/ci/test-sccache-wired.sh: assert RUSTC_WRAPPER=sccache in env, R2 bucket reachable, sccache --show-stats reports nonzero requests after a build"
