  effort: m
  description: |
    Replace 'cargo test' with 'cargo nextest run' in CI workflows. cargo-nextest is a drop-in faster test runner that parallelizes across crates (cargo test serializes per crate). 60% faster on typical Rust workspace + better failure reporting (per-test JSON output, retry support). Already widely adopted in Rust ecosystem.
