    line from all 5 apt-get install blocks in ci.yml — libwebkit2gtk-4.1-dev
    already pulls in libwebkit2gtk-4.1-0 transitively, verified there via
    `docker run ubuntu:24.04 apt-cache show libwebkit2gtk-4.1-0`. Reverified
    on this checkout: `grep -n webkit2gtk .github/workflows/ci.yml` shows
    only `libwebkit2gtk-4.1-dev` (5 occurrences) and `webkit2gtk-driver`
    (1 occurrence, tauri-cowork-e2e) — no bare `webkit2gtk-4.1` transitional
    package reference remains anywhere in the file. state.db re-imported
