- id: INFRA-2664
  domain: INFRA
  title: "RESILIENT P1: emit kind=sub_agent_dispatched + sub_agent_completed events from Agent-tool dispatch path — INFRA-2629 last-mile-rescuer Trigger 3 has no producer"
  status: blocked
  priority: P2
  effort: m
  acceptance_criteria:
    - INFRA-2629 last-mile-rescuer.sh Trigger 3 detects sub-agent stalls by scanning ambient for kind=sub_agent_dispatched events older than CHUMP_LAST_MILE_AGENT_STALL_S without a paired kind=sub_agent_completed event.
