  title: chumpd_repo_root OnceLock freezes first-call env state — poisons cargo-test process when daemon is live
  status: done
  priority: P2
  effort: s
  description: |
    In `crates/repo_path/src/lib.rs`, modify `chumpd_repo_root` to stop caching the complete repository root in a OnceLock; instead, separate the pure socket lookup (cached once) from the environment variable resolution, re-reading `CHUMP_REPO` and `CHUMP_HOME` on every call so that a later env change is honored.
    
    Target file(s):
    - crates/repo_path/src/lib.rs
    - src/web_server.rs
    
