    - "VERIFY: reopen a gap that has closed_pr set, then assert sqlite reports zero rows for status=open AND closed_pr IS NOT NULL. Today that count is 3 and cannot be driven to zero by any supported command"
    - "SCOPE: repair path for CREDIBLE-268. 268 is why gaps get falsely closed; this is why the damage cannot be fully undone once they are"
