    - "CORRECTED FRAMING (wizard 16:38Z): the detector class is QUEUE_SATURATED — fires when EITHER (a) self-hosted runners are online+idle but jobs target their labels and aren't picked up (original RUNNERS_GHOSTED case), OR (b) queued jobs target GitHub-hosted runs-on labels (ubuntu-NN/ubuntu-latest/macos/windows) and GH-hosted runner concurrency quota is exhausted (today's actual root cause, 2026-05-24 16:38Z)"
