    - QUEUE_SATURATED_GH_HOSTED + reason listing affected workflow_run_ids + runs_on_labels
    - "Remediation field per subclass: RUNNERS_GHOSTED → launchctl restart suggested, QUEUE_SATURATED_GH_HOSTED → no-restart-fix; reduce concurrent workflow triggers OR increase GH quota OR migrate to self-hosted"
    - "Smoke test scripts/ci/test-operator-recall-queue-saturated.sh: 2 stubbed scenarios — (1) self-hosted idle + jobs target their labels (asserts RUNNERS_GHOSTED), (2) GH-hosted ubuntu-latest queue + self-hosted idle but jobs target ubuntu-latest (asserts QUEUE_SATURATED_GH_HOSTED + no-restart-fix text)"
