    - "Documentation: SUBAGENT_DISPATCH.md gains the section + SHEPHERD_LOOP_PLAYBOOK.md gains Pattern 13; both cross-link to each other; existing docs/process/CLAUDE_GOTCHAS.md gains a brief entry for the hung-hook class"
  closed_date: '2026-05-29'
  closed_pr: 2658
  outcome_id: MISSION-010

