- id: MISSION-002
  domain: MISSION
  title: "MISSION: Offline-First Validation — pre-push + pre-ship local test gates"
  status: done
  priority: P2
  effort: m
  acceptance_criteria:
    - "Design phase: docs/process/OFFLINE_VALIDATION.md with three gates: (1) pre-push format/lint/type-check, (2) pre-ship unit tests, (3) pre-merge integration tests. Define what runs where and why."
    - "Gate 1 (pre-push, run in worktree): src/bin/validate-offline.rs — runs cargo fmt --check, cargo clippy --all-targets, cargo check. Outputs pass/fail + elapsed time to stdout."
    - "Gate 2 (pre-ship, run in worktree): cargo test --lib (unit tests only, skip integration). AC §2: run only on Rust file changes; skip if YAML/docs-only changes detected."
    - "Gate 3 (pre-merge, GitHub CI): full cargo test suite (integration + e2e). Only reaches GitHub if gates 1+2 pass locally."
    - "Integration: scripts/coord/chump-commit.sh calls Gate 1 after staging; chump gap ship calls Gate 2 before creating PR. Both exit 1 on failure, preventing push/PR creation."
    - "Acceptance: AC metric — 30% reduction in failed GitHub CI runs (fewer PRs with clippy/fmt errors reaching CI). Test: scripts/ci/test-offline-validation-gates.sh with synthetic Rust errors, YAML-only changes."
  notes: |
    Demoted P1→P2 2026-07-19 re-rank: open >60 days with no ship activity; P1 now reserved for current-cycle critical path (docs/ROADMAP.md). Re-promote freely if picked up.
  closed_date: '2026-07-21'
  closed_pr: 3081
  outcome_id: MISSION-010

- id: MISSION-003
  domain: MISSION
  title: "MISSION P1: curator-role pillar-assignment matrix — document distinct primary pillar per named curator + enforce no-overlap + uniform event-driven wake (operator directives 18:18Z + 18:20Z)"
  status: done
  priority: P1
  effort: s
  acceptance_criteria:
    - "Background — 2026-05-24 fleet grew to ~8 alive sessions (target / shepherd / ci-audit / handoff / decompose / md-links / overnight / autopilot / orchestrator) but pillar focus has been ad-hoc, with overlap (multiple sessions doing 'general PR rescue') and gaps (CREDIBLE at 12% of pickable, ZERO-WASTE at 5%). Operator: 'we can't have lopsided focus' (18:18Z) + 'not everyone on the team can play the same role' (18:20Z). Plus: wake-logic is inconsistent — some on 5min cron, some on event-driven Monitor (per Pattern 11 / INFRA-1936). Operator wants all on event-driven"
    - "New docs/process/CURATOR_PILLAR_MATRIX.md — single canonical table mapping each curator role to its primary pillar + secondary pillar + scope hard-boundary. Proposed: target=EFFECTIVE (Marcus arc) | shepherd=RESILIENT (PR rescue + queue health) | ci-audit=CREDIBLE (audit gates + agreement metrics) | handoff=cross-lane routing (no pillar; coordination role) | decompose=EFFECTIVE-A2A (META-074 child B + umbrella decomposition) | md-links=RESILIENT-docs (markdown + doc audits) | overnight=ZERO-WASTE (legacy cleanup + staleness) | autopilot=META-retirement (META-090 endpoint) | orchestrator=MISSION (rank + dispatch + retire-self)"
    - Update each .claude/agents/<role>.md frontmatter to declare primary_pillar field — exists in agents/target.md, agents/harvester.md, agents/orchestrator.md today; add for the other 5 as META-097 sub-fleet PRs land
    - New scripts/ci/test-curator-pillar-no-overlap.sh — assert no two .claude/agents/<role>.md files declare the same primary_pillar (handoff allowed null since it's coordination)
    - "Wake-logic uniformity — add 'session-start: arm Monitor on inbox per INBOX_WATCHER_PATTERN.md' to every .claude/agents/<role>.md (already done in target.md, harvester.md, orchestrator.md per INFRA-1936 + INFRA-1940). Smoke test: scripts/ci/test-inbox-watcher-pattern.sh enforces watcher-arm block presence across all checked-in agents"
    - Cross-reference from docs/process/OPERATOR_PLAYBOOK.md §1 Hierarchy — add a one-line link to CURATOR_PILLAR_MATRIX.md so the role table is discoverable from the playbook
    - Done definition — matrix doc shipped + CI gate enforces no-overlap + all checked-in agent .md files declare primary_pillar + smoke test green
  notes: |
    filed 18:21Z 2026-05-24 by wizard after operator's two directives in 5min window — balance focus + uniform wake. Companion to META-097 (productize remaining 5 curators) which is the structural enabler
  closed_date: '2026-07-20'
  closed_pr: 3213
  outcome_id: MISSION-010

- id: MISSION-004
  domain: MISSION
  title: "MISSION P1: scalable curator-role pipeline — scripts/coord/create-curator-role.sh scaffolder + .claude/agents/_template.md + MISSION-003 matrix extension (add wake_mode column) + CI gate enforcing role frontmatter"
  status: done
  priority: P1
  effort: s
  acceptance_criteria:
    - "Background — operator at 18:48Z: 'we need new/other roles as well so we need to scale adding roles to this.' Today we have 8 roles (target/harvester/shepherd/ci-audit/handoff/decompose/md-links/orchestrator) each created ad-hoc. As the fleet grows (Marcus customer arc + Phase 2 + future personas) we'll need to add roles weekly — needs a 3-command scaffold instead of artisan crafting"
    - "New scripts/coord/create-curator-role.sh — usage: `bash scripts/coord/create-curator-role.sh <name> --pillar <E|C|R|Z|M> --wake-mode <persistent-event|spawn-on-event|scheduled-sweep>`. Creates .claude/agents/<name>.md from template, appends to docs/process/CURATOR_PILLAR_MATRIX.md, adds entry to scripts/ci/test-inbox-watcher-pattern.sh required-roles list. Emits ambient kind=curator_role_created {name, pillar, wake_mode}"
