    - "Update docs/process/CURATOR_PILLAR_MATRIX.md (filed in MISSION-003 #2538) — add wake_mode column to the matrix. Initial row updates: target=E/persistent-event, shepherd=R/persistent-event, ci-audit=C/persistent-event, handoff=cross-lane/persistent-event, decompose=E-A2A/spawn-on-event (sparse work, no persistent session needed per wizard's 18:46Z analysis), md-links=R-docs/scheduled-sweep (daily Sonnet sweep + event-driven on docs PRs), overnight=Z/persistent-event, autopilot=META-retirement/persistent-event, orchestrator=MISSION/persistent-event"
    - "New scripts/ci/test-curator-role-frontmatter.sh — assert every .claude/agents/*.md (excluding _template.md) has required frontmatter keys: name + description + pillar + wake_mode + tools (with at least Read/Bash). Fail loudly if any role file lacks one"
