- id: MISSION-028
  domain: MISSION
  title: "MISSION P0: PICKER SPRAWL — the WORKER's picker (_pick_and_claim_gap.py) isn't mission-first in runtime; #3055 fixed the WRONG picker (_pick_gap.py); consolidate + prove mission-first with a live test"
