  notes: |
    PROBLEM: .github/workflows/upshift-app-scan.yml 'scan' job fails on every Dependabot PR with 'Error: Input required and not supplied: app_id' — Dependabot PRs do not receive repo secrets (APP_ID/APP_PRIVATE_KEY), so the tibdex/github-app-token step errors. This blocks all open dependency PRs (#2,#3,#4) from merging.
    
    FIX (minimal, workflow-only): guard the scan job so it does not run on Dependabot-triggered PRs, e.g. add job-level 'if: ${{ github.actor != 'dependabot[bot]' }}' to the scan job in .github/workflows/upshift-app-scan.yml.
    
    ACCEPTANCE CRITERIA:
    1. The scan job is skipped (not failed) on Dependabot PRs.
    2. The scan job still runs unchanged on human/non-Dependabot PRs (no security coverage lost).
    3. Only .github/workflows/upshift-app-scan.yml changes; no secrets added/committed; no other workflow behavior altered.
    4. yaml remains valid.
  closed_pr: 8
  outcome_id: CHUMPOS

