  description: |
    Farmer's Playbook precondition #6 (docs/process/FARMER_PLAYBOOK.md). The fleet flies blind or cannot decide when the coordination substrate dies: NATS down (the A2A bus), smee-client/github-webhook-receiver down (github_cache.db stops updating -> GraphQL exhaustion blinds every agent), or the deliberator down/heartbeat-only (consensus cannot emit verdicts -> the fleet can't decide -> a human must conduct). Make the farmer (RESILIENT-068) keep these alive each tick: (a) NATS server liveness; (b) smee-client + github-webhook-receiver liveness + github_cache.db freshness (last-update age); (c) deliberator daemon alive AND actually tallying (not heartbeat-only). Gate all on AUTONOMY_LEVEL>=1.
