    - MISSION-012 deploy run-on-stale-binary succeeds end-to-end on this machine; chump --version after run matches origin/main HEAD
    - "Test: simulate concurrent stale-worktree-reaper.sh run while refresh-runner-binary.sh is building — build still succeeds"
  notes: |
