    - "Fix: every internal step in bot-merge.sh MUST call _bm_step_start before any work and _bm_step_done (with rc) after, OR explicitly log+exit with a named exit code. Add a global trap that records 'unknown_step_silent_failure' to .steps and ambient if exit is non-zero with no terminal step recorded"
