    - "Doctrine cross-ref: CREDIBLE-105 case study — every reader (fresh-eyes, observability, blame_bot) silently fails or partially-fails on malformed lines, producing wrong intel that LOOKS like the right answer. Same family as CREDIBLE-120 / 121 / 123"
