    - "Exit code is honest: a comparator that cannot run must NOT yield exit 1 (all-clear) — surface the failure so the mirror never silently reports clean"
    - scripts/ci/test-*.sh regression guard runs the loop under /bin/bash and asserts no 'bad substitution'; fails without the fix
