  status: done
  priority: P1
  effort: s
  acceptance_criteria:
    - determine whether chump-coord worker (subscribe side) is supposed to run as a persistent daemon and, if so, why it isn't running on this box -- check for a missing/uninstalled launchd plist vs. a deliberate manual-start design
    - start it (or fix the daemon-install gap) and observe at least one real FEEDBACK proposal go through vote to tally
    - either observe a real consensus_result event fire (count 0 -> >=1) or determine the alternate explanation (event renamed, or no quorum-eligible proposal exists yet) and document which
    - "test: after this gap ships, grep -c consensus_result .chump-locks/ambient.jsonl returns >=1, or a documented reason explains why that's not yet the correct check"
  closed_date: '2026-07-30'
