    A2A_MASTER_PLAN_2026-06-03.md's SS5 M1 callout identified as the actual blocker: "the last
    mile is one bug + one flag, not a flag-flip alone... GATE: consensus_result count goes 0 -> >=1")
    
    THEORY: the fix (RESILIENT-061) shipped, and the flags are on, but the subscribe-side daemon
    (chump-coord worker) that would actually consume messages and let a deliberator tick run
    against a live proposal isn't currently running -- so the gate the plan's own authors defined
    has never actually been exercised end-to-end, even though every named component shows done.
    Classic component-done-but-system-unproven gap, same class as the INFRA-3485/INFRA-3516
