    bypasses the blanket cargo-active abort" spawns a fake `rustc` process,
    runs the reaper script with CHUMP_DISK_CRITICAL_GB=999999 (forcing
    aggressive mode), captures its output via `out_agg="$(... 2>&1 || true)"`,
    then greps for "ABORT: active cargo" (fail) or "escalating" (pass) --
    neither matched. The "printf: write error: Broken pipe" at the exact same
