    closed pipe mid-write (the fake rustc process exiting, or a downstream
    reader closing early under CI resource-timing variance), so `$out_agg`
    never contains either expected string -- a test-harness robustness bug in
    how this subtest captures subprocess output, not a real regression in
    cargo-target-reaper.sh's actual aggressive-mode logic.
    
