    [2026-08-29T09:57:51Z] INFRA-3832 auto-block: 3 consecutive non-ship cycles (last kind=rc=1, rc=1, cycle_log=6005B). Worker kept re-picking + looping; blocked to leave the pick pool. Un-block after fixing the spec / decomposing.
