  status: done
  priority: P1
  effort: m
  description: |
    Root cause of the 2026-07-26 disk-100% incident. worker.sh:158 defaults CARGO_TARGET_DIR to $HOME/.cargo/chump-shared-target (canonical, asserted by test-cargo-target-dir.sh), but the run-fleet launcher that started the 05:35 session set CARGO_TARGET_DIR=~/Projects/Chump/target explicitly, overriding it. Result: TWO live target dirs for one project — Chump/target (54G, debug/deps=40G) + ~/.cargo/chump-shared-target (27G) = ~81G. Interactive/curator builds from the main checkout also default to Chump/target. Fix converges ALL build entrypoints (fleet launcher, curators, interactive) on the one shared target so the per-repo target stops regenerating.
