    - grep the fleet launcher (run-fleet.sh / scripts/dispatch/*) for any CARGO_TARGET_DIR export that overrides worker.sh's shared default; remove or point it at chump-shared-target
    - all fleet+curator entrypoints resolve to a single CARGO_TARGET_DIR (~/.cargo/chump-shared-target) — verified by launching a worker and confirming builds land there, not in Chump/target
    - test-cargo-target-dir.sh extended to assert the launcher does not re-override the shared path
    - after convergence, Chump/target is safe to delete and does not regenerate under fleet load
  notes: |
    [2026-07-26T19:30:09Z] [gap-bankruptcy 2026-07-26] test fixture / malformed gap pollution. Reversible via `chump gap requeue ZERO-WASTE-029`.
  closed_pr: 3551

