  status: blocked
  priority: P2
  effort: m
  acceptance_criteria:
    - "MACHINERY EXISTS — this is scheduling and closing a taxonomy, not building curation. 'chump gap triage' classifies non-pickable gaps and prescribes a remedy (vague-ac->add-ac, too-large->decompose, false-dep->strip-dep) and its --apply does ONLY provably-safe fixes (strip deps on already-done gaps, demote P2->P3). 'chump gap consolidate' does near-duplicate title detection. 'chump gap write-ac' fills criteria (shipped 2026-08-07). Retirement is already normal practice: 955 superseded + 802 wontfix against 1742 done — the fleet retires about as much as it ships"
    - "NOTHING IS SCHEDULED: 0 cron/launchd entries reference triage, consolidate or gardener (measured 2026-08-07). Eighth instance of the built-not-wired pattern in one session — see ZERO-WASTE-036"
    - "DETECTORS ARE BLIND TO THE DOMINANT CASE, fix before scheduling or the loop will certify a broken queue as healthy: triage finds 2 vague-ac and audit-ac finds 6, while 74 of 240 open gaps carry the default_acceptance_criteria template. All three must count template-AC as vague (see EFFECTIVE-407)"
